diff --git a/CLAUDE.md b/CLAUDE.md
index 43c994c2..c2e371cc 100644
--- a/CLAUDE.md
+++ b/CLAUDE.md
@@ -1 +1,9 @@
 @AGENTS.md
+
+External fleet sessions retain their existing ACP routing binding. Their typed
+`externalSession` metadata identifies the native Claude Code or Codex engine,
+separately from the discovery connection. Never move an imported conversation to
+a driver that starts a replacement worker. Metadata-only enrichment uses the
+existing event/persistence owners and must preserve conversation activity times.
+Discovery connections belong in Connections settings, not new-session provider
+selection; existing bindings remain usable while their metadata is loading.
